    "enUS": {
      "description": "As a rogue of the Shattered Hand, it is imperative that you learn the Shattered Salute. It is the only way to truly identify another member of the Hand.\n\nWatch, learn, repeat.",
      "dialogue": {
        "073aea8779c1424669a9": "Well done, $N. You are now ready to proceed.",
        "8d287b7df964b35a7dc5": "As a rogue of the Shattered Hand, it is imperative that you learn the Shattered Salute. It is the only way to truly identify another member of the Hand.$B$BWatch, learn, repeat.",
